    "4": {
      "note": "The minimized line's head is now an accessible button surface: a click outside a nested control, Enter or space expands it. controlWithin excludes button, a, input, textarea, select and elements with role button, link or menuitem; it does not inspect generic contenteditable elements so the existing ⊕ button and Close control keep their own actions; the line does not intercept their clicks or keys. The expanded pick/message/Send view and Close-retains-picks policy remain unchanged.\n\nAnchor: `controlWithin`",
